  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "C.Vairalingam vs Union Of India on 16 December, 2024 Author: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan Bench: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.No.32348 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 16.12.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mrs.Justice V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.No.32348 of 2024 C.Vairalingam Technical Officer Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, Central Documentation Complex, 2nd Floor, Rajaji Salai, Chennai 600 001. ... Petitioner Vs. 1. Union of India, Rep. by its Secretary, Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, 156, 'A' Wing, Nirman Bhavan, New Delhi 110 011. 2. The Chairperson, Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, Fda Bhavan, Kotla Road, New Delhi 110 002. 3. The Chief Executive Officer, Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, Fda Bhavan, Kotla Road, New Delhi 110 002. 4. The Executive Director, Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, Fda Bhavan, Kotla Road, New Delhi 110 002. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/6 W C.Vairalingam vs Union Of India on 16 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/47311343/ 1 5. The Director, Food Safety and Standards Authority of India, Southern Regional Office, 2nd Floor, Central Documentation Complex, Ch.P.T. Building, Rajaji Salai, Chennai 600 001. ... Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Consti to issue a Writ of Mandamus, directing the 3rd respondent to consid past service of the petitioner as a Technical Officer on contractua under the 5th respondent from 01.01.2013 to 31.01.2021 and consider petitioner's seniority with the present appointment of the petition Technical Officer on direct recruitment with effect from 01.02.2021 claimed in his representation dated 19.05.2023 in a time bound peri For Petitioner : Mr.K.Mohanamurali For R1 : Mr.R.Sidharth Central Government Co For R2 to R5 : Mr.R.Rajesh Vivekanandan Deputy Solicitor General Order",
    "facts": "The case of the petitioner is that, he was appointed as a Technical Officer on 01.06.2012 in the respondent management on contract basis and his contract was renewed by the 3rd respondent periodically from 01.06.2012 to 31.01.2021 without any break in the service. In the meanwhile, the petitioner was appointed as Technical Officer through direct recruitment on 09.01.2021 and the 3rd respondent relieved him on 31.01.2021 where he worked as Technical Officer on contract since 01.01.2013 to 31.01.2021 without any gap. After relieving, the petitioner joined as Technical Officer with effect from 01.02.2021 at FSSAI, New Delhi, from contract to regular appointment. However, his seniority has not been fixed from the date of his appointment as Technical Officer on contract basis. Hence, the petitioner submitted a detailed representation to the 3rd respondent on 19.05.2023.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
